{
  "hero_headline": "AI 迭代与地缘局势双重冲击：全球市场迈入动荡调整期 / AI Iteration and Geopolitical Tensions: Global Markets Enter a Volatile Adjustment Phase",
  "daily_overview": "全球科技界正加速迈向「GPT-6 与智能代理」的新时代，OpenAI 的 Astra 系列等前沿模型展现出更强的计算机使用与代码能力，但硬件缺口及算力瓶颈仍是限制规模化应用的核心挑战。财经方面，全球通胀压力回升迫使央行重新收紧货币政策，叠加中东局势升级导致的油价上扬，市场避险情绪显著。与此同时，地缘政治冲突与资源争夺——从霍尔木兹海峡的航运争端到跨境贸易限制，正深刻重塑全球贸易格局，企业在全球扩张时需审慎评估合规与供应链风险。\n\nGlobal technology is accelerating toward a new era of \"GPT-6 and AI Agents,\" as frontier models like OpenAI’s Astra demonstrate enhanced computer-use and coding capabilities, though hardware shortages and compute bottlenecks remain primary constraints. Financially, resurgent global inflation is compelling central banks to tighten monetary policy, while rising oil prices amid Middle East tensions drive investor risk aversion. Simultaneously, geopolitical conflicts and resource competition—ranging from disputes in the Strait of Hormuz to cross-border trade restrictions—are profoundly reshaping the global trade landscape, requiring businesses to carefully assess compliance and supply chain risks.",
